1
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,700
=The Road to Splendor=

2
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

3
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:37,968
=Episode 31=

4
00:01:38,190 --> 00:01:40,110
Your Majesty,
please judge this matter fairly!

5
00:01:40,110 --> 00:01:41,750
Your Majesty,
please judge this matter fairly!

6
00:01:42,470 --> 00:01:44,270
(Northwest bribery, merchant murder)
Not even Wu's remains were left.

7
00:01:44,589 --> 00:01:47,030
(Destroying evidence, a heartless act)
When Wu refused their bribe demand,

8
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:48,589
the Northwest officials killed her!

9
00:01:48,589 --> 00:01:50,309
Where is justice?

10
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:54,069
Those people in the Northwest
have gone too far.

11
00:01:54,069 --> 00:01:54,949
The salt reform

12
00:01:54,949 --> 00:01:57,190
is clearly meant to benefit the people,

13
00:01:57,550 --> 00:01:59,869
yet they keep blocking it at every turn,

14
00:01:59,949 --> 00:02:01,509
afraid it will cost them
their own profits.

15
00:02:03,030 --> 00:02:05,429
Where is justice?

16
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:07,110
How dare you!

17
00:02:07,949 --> 00:02:09,189
Gathering a crowd to cause trouble

18
00:02:09,189 --> 00:02:10,429
and disturbing His Majesty?

19
00:02:10,709 --> 00:02:11,309
Do you realize

20
00:02:11,589 --> 00:02:12,749
what you're risking?

21
00:02:12,749 --> 00:02:14,909
(Northwest bribery, merchant murder)
Your Majesty, please investigate it!

22
00:02:14,909 --> 00:02:16,629
(Northwest bribery, merchant murder)
Give the Wu family justice!

23
00:02:16,629 --> 00:02:18,909
We beg Your Majesty
to investigate the Northwest!

24
00:02:18,909 --> 00:02:20,990
Give the Wu family justice!

25
00:02:20,990 --> 00:02:23,550
We beg Your Majesty
to investigate the Northwest!

26
00:02:23,550 --> 00:02:25,670
Give the Wu family justice!

27
00:02:26,070 --> 00:02:26,990
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

28
00:02:27,510 --> 00:02:28,469
This protest by the Anzhou merchants

29
00:02:29,110 --> 00:02:30,510
must have been orchestrated by someone
behind the scenes.

30
00:02:30,830 --> 00:02:31,790
I request permission

31
00:02:32,230 --> 00:02:32,749
to immediately...

32
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:39,309
Merchants are kneeling outside,

33
00:02:39,790 --> 00:02:41,429
and the people are in an uproar.

34
00:02:42,270 --> 00:02:43,270
This matter

35
00:02:44,070 --> 00:02:45,670
must come to a resolution.

36
00:02:48,790 --> 00:02:50,429
General Mo is incorruptible.

37
00:02:51,029 --> 00:02:52,189
He would never embezzle funds,

38
00:02:52,629 --> 00:02:54,189
much less extort merchants for bribes.

39
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:58,990
Please reconsider, Your Majesty.

40
00:02:59,550 --> 00:03:01,029
How could I not know

41
00:03:01,189 --> 00:03:03,070
that the Northwest guards
the state's vital frontier,

42
00:03:03,230 --> 00:03:04,909
keeping Wangur from daring
to invade again?

43
00:03:05,230 --> 00:03:06,270
I remember

44
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:07,790
all they have done.

45
00:03:09,110 --> 00:03:10,629
But sometimes,

46
00:03:11,429 --> 00:03:12,670
emotions and reason

47
00:03:13,830 --> 00:03:15,230
cannot both be served.

48
00:03:17,429 --> 00:03:18,189
Before,

49
00:03:18,390 --> 00:03:19,709
the Grand Empress Dowager
stepped forward

50
00:03:19,830 --> 00:03:21,429
to resolve the imperial mausoleum
matter.

51
00:03:22,909 --> 00:03:23,790
But later,

52
00:03:23,790 --> 00:03:25,790
I still issued
an edict of self-criticism.

53
00:03:26,869 --> 00:03:27,909
Do you think

54
00:03:28,429 --> 00:03:29,589
that edict

55
00:03:29,909 --> 00:03:31,869
was meant for the people to see,

56
00:03:32,309 --> 00:03:33,350
or was it meant

57
00:03:33,469 --> 00:03:34,790
for my grandmother?

58
00:03:42,230 --> 00:03:44,510
In that edict, I condemned myself,

59
00:03:44,869 --> 00:03:45,950
but in truth,

60
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:47,429
I was condemning my grandmother.

61
00:03:47,990 --> 00:03:49,909
I hoped she would take it as a warning

62
00:03:49,990 --> 00:03:51,830
and stop acting beyond proper bounds.

63
00:03:52,709 --> 00:03:54,230
The Grand Empress Dowager said

64
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:57,589
she would not bring up the matter
of joint burial for now.

65
00:03:57,869 --> 00:03:59,830
I don't want her
to merely let it go this time.

66
00:04:00,589 --> 00:04:02,469
I want her to never mention it

67
00:04:02,830 --> 00:04:03,990
again.

68
00:04:05,189 --> 00:04:06,510
I told you before,

69
00:04:07,029 --> 00:04:08,909
I truly respect my grandmother.

70
00:04:09,990 --> 00:04:12,110
Yet I must deceive her,

71
00:04:12,309 --> 00:04:13,230
and even

72
00:04:13,589 --> 00:04:15,510
leave her condemned
in the history books.

73
00:04:16,069 --> 00:04:17,230
Do you think

74
00:04:17,629 --> 00:04:19,030
it doesn't pain me?

75
00:04:19,749 --> 00:04:21,509
But sitting on this throne,

76
00:04:22,389 --> 00:04:23,710
I must weigh

77
00:04:24,670 --> 00:04:26,869
even my own feelings
against the greater good.

78
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:29,470
As a matter of fact,

79
00:04:29,869 --> 00:04:31,869
I've known Mo Yi

80
00:04:32,429 --> 00:04:34,309
even longer than you have.

81
00:04:35,509 --> 00:04:37,110
Do you remember?

82
00:04:43,230 --> 00:04:43,949
Huchen,

83
00:04:44,629 --> 00:04:45,949
I believe

84
00:04:46,230 --> 00:04:47,509
we've talked enough.

85
00:04:48,710 --> 00:04:50,110
But I want to ask you one thing.

86
00:04:50,869 --> 00:04:51,710
Are you

87
00:04:52,230 --> 00:04:53,309
my man,

88
00:04:54,110 --> 00:04:55,829
or the Northwest's?

89
00:05:05,550 --> 00:05:07,110
If Mo Yi's case isn't resolved,

90
00:05:07,509 --> 00:05:09,269
the Northwest's reputation
will be ruined.

91
00:05:09,790 --> 00:05:10,949
The salt reform cannot move forward,

92
00:05:11,069 --> 00:05:12,710
and the court's deadlock will remain.

93
00:05:13,509 --> 00:05:14,829
You know which matters more.

94
00:05:20,790 --> 00:05:21,790
Your work

95
00:05:22,470 --> 00:05:23,869
has always earned my trust.

96
00:05:24,790 --> 00:05:25,629
This time,

97
00:05:26,429 --> 00:05:27,949
don't disappoint me.

98
00:05:31,710 --> 00:05:32,509
Your Majesty,

99
00:05:40,910 --> 00:05:42,509
I will not fail you.

100
00:05:45,629 --> 00:05:46,949
Concubine Wu

101
00:05:47,110 --> 00:05:49,030
has always been unpredictable.

102
00:05:50,030 --> 00:05:52,110
She should have delivered it by now.

103
00:05:53,949 --> 00:05:54,869
Could it be

104
00:05:56,110 --> 00:05:57,470
she's changed her mind?

105
00:05:58,869 --> 00:05:59,710
Wait a little longer.

106
00:06:01,408 --> 00:06:03,584
(Graceful and Virtuous)

107
00:06:06,269 --> 00:06:06,949
Madam.

108
00:06:09,749 --> 00:06:11,110
Jingxiu

109
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:12,269
has been troubled lately.

110
00:06:12,470 --> 00:06:13,910
Go keep him company for a while.

111
00:06:15,710 --> 00:06:17,470
This is aged Lihua Bai wine.

112
00:06:17,749 --> 00:06:18,829
It's perfect

113
00:06:19,470 --> 00:06:20,790
for helping him open his heart.

114
00:06:28,030 --> 00:06:29,110
Thank you, Madam.

115
00:06:29,110 --> 00:06:30,629
The Yu family has few heirs.

116
00:06:30,910 --> 00:06:33,389
Young Madam is no longer an option.

117
00:06:33,749 --> 00:06:34,509
You've been

118
00:06:35,309 --> 00:06:37,110
in this household for quite some time.

119
00:06:37,590 --> 00:06:38,990
No matter whom a woman relies on,

120
00:06:39,629 --> 00:06:41,550
no one is more dependable
than her own child.

121
00:06:43,990 --> 00:06:45,069
I understand.

122
00:06:45,629 --> 00:06:46,749
Good.

123
00:06:46,749 --> 00:06:47,910
Go on, then.

124
00:06:48,030 --> 00:06:49,230
An opportunity like this is rare.

125
00:06:49,389 --> 00:06:50,910
I'm only thinking of what's best
for you.

126
00:06:51,590 --> 00:06:52,309
Yes,

127
00:06:52,309 --> 00:06:52,949
Madam.

128
00:07:00,350 --> 00:07:01,710
I chose the Yu family

129
00:07:02,189 --> 00:07:03,470
not for wealth or status.

130
00:07:03,829 --> 00:07:05,389
I thought a family of scholars

131
00:07:05,590 --> 00:07:07,230
would not be home to such wicked people.

132
00:07:07,790 --> 00:07:08,670
But now,

133
00:07:09,069 --> 00:07:10,829
my aunt died because of the Yu family.

134
00:07:12,429 --> 00:07:13,790
I was wrong about them once.

135
00:07:14,230 --> 00:07:16,030
I won't make the same mistake again.

136
00:07:16,949 --> 00:07:18,110
I need to find a way

137
00:07:18,590 --> 00:07:19,790
to get my aunt's journal

138
00:07:19,790 --> 00:07:20,550
out of here.

139
00:07:20,550 --> 00:07:21,949
My Lady, please reconsider.

140
00:07:22,869 --> 00:07:23,829
Right now,

141
00:07:23,829 --> 00:07:24,949
the household is watching closely.

142
00:07:25,629 --> 00:07:26,509
There are even

143
00:07:26,990 --> 00:07:28,470
servants guarding the door.

144
00:07:28,869 --> 00:07:29,910
It will be difficult

145
00:07:29,910 --> 00:07:31,269
to send anything out again.

146
00:07:36,224 --> 00:07:38,580
(Qingli Hall of Learning)

147
00:07:52,869 --> 00:07:53,670
Young Master.

148
00:07:55,670 --> 00:07:56,470
What?

149
00:07:57,309 --> 00:07:59,110
Mother couldn't get Young Madam
to do it,

150
00:07:59,710 --> 00:08:00,910
so now she's sending you instead?

151
00:08:01,710 --> 00:08:03,470
Whatever happens between Madam
and Young Madam

152
00:08:03,829 --> 00:08:05,429
has nothing to do with me.

153
00:08:13,189 --> 00:08:14,670
I only thought

154
00:08:15,110 --> 00:08:16,509
you were troubled at the moment.

155
00:08:16,990 --> 00:08:18,269
You may need someone to comfort you.

156
00:08:22,230 --> 00:08:23,990
You are both people who have fallen
on hard times.

157
00:08:24,829 --> 00:08:26,030
Ninth Young Lady

158
00:08:27,069 --> 00:08:28,949
is having a difficult time herself.

159
00:08:35,310 --> 00:08:37,190
She has lost her mother and then
her father in quick succession.

160
00:08:38,230 --> 00:08:39,590
Her heart is already heavy with grief.

161
00:08:40,629 --> 00:08:42,070
And yet, at a time like this,

162
00:08:43,830 --> 00:08:45,869
my father still used the past
to humiliate her.

163
00:08:56,190 --> 00:08:58,110
I went to Tanshui Temple today

164
00:08:58,789 --> 00:09:00,310
to pray for my aunt.

165
00:09:01,830 --> 00:09:03,029
I also thought

166
00:09:04,629 --> 00:09:06,669
of lighting a prayer lamp
for the Ninth Young Lady.

167
00:09:12,629 --> 00:09:13,430
Young Master.

168
00:09:14,230 --> 00:09:16,669
If the scripture is touched
by the worldly presence of others,

169
00:09:17,029 --> 00:09:18,350
it may lose its blessing.

170
00:09:26,710 --> 00:09:27,830
I know

171
00:09:28,389 --> 00:09:29,909
you still care about her.

172
00:09:30,310 --> 00:09:31,070
Why not

173
00:09:31,470 --> 00:09:32,830
send someone to take this

174
00:09:33,029 --> 00:09:34,190
to Xie Jewelry Shop?

175
00:09:34,629 --> 00:09:35,950
Consider it a way to repay

176
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:37,230
the kindness she showed me.

177
00:09:50,549 --> 00:09:51,269
Chengxin.

178
00:09:53,669 --> 00:09:54,350
Young Master.

179
00:09:54,629 --> 00:09:55,470
Take this there.

180
00:09:56,470 --> 00:09:57,230
Remember,

181
00:09:58,470 --> 00:10:00,430
do not let anyone else touch it.

182
00:10:01,830 --> 00:10:02,990
It may ruin the blessing.

183
00:10:04,310 --> 00:10:04,830
Yes.

184
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:12,896
(The Diamond Sutra)

185
00:10:13,749 --> 00:10:14,509
Just as I thought.

186
00:10:15,230 --> 00:10:16,029
Madam Wu

187
00:10:16,190 --> 00:10:17,629
was bribing officials to push
the salt reforms forward.

188
00:10:18,230 --> 00:10:19,470
And the Mo family wasn't the only one.

189
00:10:20,190 --> 00:10:21,070
This records

190
00:10:21,070 --> 00:10:22,629
the preferences of influential families.

191
00:10:22,830 --> 00:10:23,749
Excellent.

192
00:10:23,909 --> 00:10:25,070
With this,

193
00:10:25,070 --> 00:10:27,230
we can prove Madam Wu
donated the money voluntarily.

194
00:10:27,230 --> 00:10:28,629
There's hope for the Northwest.

195
00:10:29,950 --> 00:10:30,749
There's hope.

196
00:10:31,830 --> 00:10:32,749
There's hope.

197
00:10:35,310 --> 00:10:35,909
Madam.

198
00:10:36,470 --> 00:10:37,629
Madam, someone is here.

199
00:10:37,710 --> 00:10:38,430
No.

200
00:10:38,430 --> 00:10:39,310
I won't see anyone.

201
00:10:39,310 --> 00:10:40,470
It's Commander Zhao.

202
00:10:53,029 --> 00:10:54,029
Madam Mo.

203
00:10:54,669 --> 00:10:55,710
Commander Zhao.

204
00:11:00,669 --> 00:11:02,470
His Majesty has ordered me
to handle this matter.

205
00:11:03,629 --> 00:11:04,789
Do you have any message

206
00:11:07,669 --> 00:11:08,869
for General Mo?

207
00:11:10,950 --> 00:11:12,509
If you're the one questioning Mo Yi,

208
00:11:13,669 --> 00:11:15,070
then I can rest assured.

209
00:11:15,749 --> 00:11:16,350
By the way,

210
00:11:16,509 --> 00:11:18,190
I happen to have something to send him.

211
00:11:18,269 --> 00:11:18,869
Commander Zhao,

212
00:11:18,869 --> 00:11:19,669
please have a seat.

213
00:11:28,549 --> 00:11:29,230
It's fine.

214
00:11:29,749 --> 00:11:30,470
It's fine.

215
00:11:31,470 --> 00:11:32,190
Take it.

216
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:40,470
Mo Yi may be

217
00:11:40,590 --> 00:11:41,669
a tough man,

218
00:11:42,869 --> 00:11:44,470
but he's never had to endure

219
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:45,509
the hardships of prison.

220
00:11:45,990 --> 00:11:46,909
The weather is turning cold.

221
00:11:47,350 --> 00:11:48,070
It's cold in the cell.

222
00:11:48,869 --> 00:11:50,070
My children and I

223
00:11:51,190 --> 00:11:52,590
spent three days and nights

224
00:11:53,029 --> 00:11:54,029
making this for him.

225
00:11:54,629 --> 00:11:56,029
Please make sure he gets it.

226
00:12:03,909 --> 00:12:04,830
Is there anything

227
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:09,629
you'd like me to tell General Mo?

228
00:12:14,350 --> 00:12:15,470
We've been married for years.

229
00:12:15,869 --> 00:12:17,269
There's no need for sweet words.

230
00:12:19,470 --> 00:12:20,430
Whatever needs to be said,

231
00:12:22,509 --> 00:12:24,110
I'll tell him when he comes home.

232
00:13:16,430 --> 00:13:17,070
Mo Yi.

233
00:13:17,190 --> 00:13:17,789
Time for questioning.

234
00:13:36,470 --> 00:13:37,430
Ling.

235
00:13:38,110 --> 00:13:39,950
I'm relieved it's you.

236
00:13:53,070 --> 00:13:54,830
Quite a feast.

237
00:13:55,669 --> 00:13:56,669
How long has it been

238
00:13:58,389 --> 00:14:00,310
since we had a drink together?

239
00:14:01,549 --> 00:14:02,070
Here.

240
00:14:02,830 --> 00:14:03,590
Tonight,

241
00:14:04,669 --> 00:14:06,350
let's share a few good cups.

242
00:14:07,470 --> 00:14:08,230
Fill them up.

243
00:14:16,789 --> 00:14:17,590
Smells wonderful.

244
00:14:25,110 --> 00:14:26,389
Technically,

245
00:14:26,830 --> 00:14:28,310
I'm a few years older than you,

246
00:14:29,269 --> 00:14:30,310
and I also

247
00:14:30,789 --> 00:14:32,389
entered court service
a few years before you did.

248
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:34,549
You should call me Brother.

249
00:14:36,310 --> 00:14:37,430
But

250
00:14:37,549 --> 00:14:38,990
to be fair,

251
00:14:41,110 --> 00:14:43,549
you surpass me in every way.

252
00:14:45,350 --> 00:14:46,869
The achievements in Yongning Prefecture,

253
00:14:48,029 --> 00:14:49,590
the honor of the Northwest Army,

254
00:14:50,389 --> 00:14:52,110
all of it is thanks to you.

255
00:14:54,350 --> 00:14:54,789
Come on.

256
00:14:55,830 --> 00:14:56,710
This toast

257
00:14:58,269 --> 00:14:58,990
is to you.

258
00:14:59,669 --> 00:15:00,549
Consider it

259
00:15:01,269 --> 00:15:02,230
my thanks.

260
00:15:03,749 --> 00:15:04,909
General Mo, your bravery

261
00:15:07,470 --> 00:15:09,190
rid me of Feng Laosi,

262
00:15:11,430 --> 00:15:13,070
and gave me a chance to survive.

263
00:15:16,070 --> 00:15:17,990
You also guided me in Ganlin Town.

264
00:15:22,869 --> 00:15:24,070
I should be the one to toast you.

265
00:15:26,230 --> 00:15:27,710
Didn't I tell you to call me Brother?

266
00:15:29,230 --> 00:15:31,230
Why are you still calling me General Mo?

267
00:15:32,950 --> 00:15:34,389
Don't you see me as your brother
anymore?

268
00:15:40,110 --> 00:15:41,310
Brother Mo.

269
00:15:46,830 --> 00:15:47,350
Cheers.

270
00:15:54,110 --> 00:15:54,990
Ling.

271
00:15:56,190 --> 00:15:57,029
I know

272
00:15:58,070 --> 00:15:59,070
the Northwest

273
00:16:00,830 --> 00:16:02,310
can't afford to be dragged into this.

274
00:16:03,710 --> 00:16:05,029
It's my own fault.

275
00:16:05,749 --> 00:16:06,749
I insisted on

276
00:16:08,350 --> 00:16:10,509
chasing the same fame
and power as others.

277
00:16:11,269 --> 00:16:12,230
And in the end,

278
00:16:13,590 --> 00:16:14,830
all I got in return

279
00:16:19,789 --> 00:16:22,230
was a blade turned against me.

280
00:16:23,590 --> 00:16:25,350
You've suffered enough
because of me, Ling.

281
00:16:26,789 --> 00:16:28,350
And now you have to clean up my mess.

282
00:16:34,749 --> 00:16:35,789
Does my wife

283
00:16:37,230 --> 00:16:38,909
have anything to say to me?

284
00:16:45,029 --> 00:16:46,350
She said...

285
00:16:51,710 --> 00:16:53,749
She hoped to be your wife again
in another life.

286
00:17:01,190 --> 00:17:02,389
Ling,

287
00:17:02,470 --> 00:17:03,110
you...

288
00:17:03,389 --> 00:17:05,269
You really don't know her well enough.

289
00:17:05,789 --> 00:17:06,910
Let me tell you something.

290
00:17:07,470 --> 00:17:09,470
Even if you had me executed right now,

291
00:17:09,910 --> 00:17:11,630
she'd shed a few tears,

292
00:17:11,630 --> 00:17:13,870
and never want to see me again
in the next life.

293
00:17:17,470 --> 00:17:18,589
Still, Ling,

294
00:17:19,430 --> 00:17:21,309
I appreciate your kindness.

295
00:17:22,710 --> 00:17:23,190
Come on.

296
00:17:26,950 --> 00:17:27,549
Bottoms up.

297
00:17:45,910 --> 00:17:46,910
All right.

298
00:17:48,390 --> 00:17:50,069
It's almost time.

299
00:17:52,470 --> 00:17:53,549
Time to do this.

300
00:17:56,910 --> 00:17:58,109
But Ling,

301
00:17:59,269 --> 00:18:00,470
this time,

302
00:18:01,749 --> 00:18:03,950
you'll have to be the one to do it.

303
00:18:04,910 --> 00:18:06,109
These are turbulent times.

304
00:18:07,069 --> 00:18:08,029
Don't give His Majesty

305
00:18:08,029 --> 00:18:09,870
any reason to doubt you.

306
00:18:27,349 --> 00:18:27,870
Come on.

307
00:18:54,789 --> 00:18:55,710
Ling...

308
00:18:57,390 --> 00:18:58,309
From now on,

309
00:18:59,309 --> 00:19:02,029
I'll have to leave my wife and children
in your care.

310
00:19:02,630 --> 00:19:03,549
Consider it

311
00:19:04,309 --> 00:19:06,349
the fulfillment of the bond
we shared as brothers in arms.

312
00:19:06,749 --> 00:19:07,509
Will you do that for me?

313
00:19:10,289 --> 00:19:11,410
Don't worry.

314
00:19:53,984 --> 00:19:59,340
♪The wind sweeps the yellow sands,
as a grand ballad rings out♪

315
00:19:59,872 --> 00:20:04,400
♪A lone rider heads
for the distant frontier♪

316
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:11,232
♪The road stretches on,
swallowed by wind and sand♪

317
00:20:11,792 --> 00:20:17,040
♪My unyielding spirit shines
across the land♪

318
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:23,520
♪The wind howls,
yet never chills my soul♪

319
00:20:24,128 --> 00:20:29,840
♪War drums resound across the vast sky♪

320
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:35,744
♪I laugh to the heavens to hide my sobs♪

321
00:20:36,256 --> 00:20:41,840
♪Looking back, this life was a song♪

322
00:20:45,488 --> 00:20:52,480
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a song♪

323
00:21:13,069 --> 00:21:14,470
You're back so late.

324
00:21:15,109 --> 00:21:16,309
Have you had dinner?

325
00:21:22,630 --> 00:21:24,190
Regarding Madam Wu's case,

326
00:21:24,910 --> 00:21:26,470
I found a piece of evidence.

327
00:21:26,549 --> 00:21:27,589
It may prove useful.

328
00:21:28,309 --> 00:21:29,470
I'll show it to you.

329
00:21:30,309 --> 00:21:30,950
Don't go.

330
00:21:41,710 --> 00:21:42,950
Stay with me for a while.

331
00:22:23,349 --> 00:22:24,509
Madam Wu's case

332
00:22:27,390 --> 00:22:28,589
will be resolved soon.

333
00:22:29,390 --> 00:22:30,950
The Northwest will be fine.

334
00:22:32,910 --> 00:22:33,630
Really?

335
00:22:35,749 --> 00:22:37,029
A few days ago,

336
00:22:38,430 --> 00:22:40,349
weren't the Anzhou merchants
still causing a scene?

337
00:22:42,309 --> 00:22:43,710
How did they

338
00:22:43,710 --> 00:22:45,190
give up so quickly?

339
00:22:46,710 --> 00:22:47,630
His Majesty

340
00:22:50,430 --> 00:22:51,630
upheld justice.

341
00:22:54,190 --> 00:22:56,829
And with the Grand Empress Dowager
granting Madam Wu a lavish burial,

342
00:22:58,190 --> 00:22:59,789
the matter has come to an end.

343
00:23:06,710 --> 00:23:07,990
There must be a lot going on

344
00:23:08,349 --> 00:23:09,749
in the capital lately.

345
00:23:11,910 --> 00:23:13,029
Try not to go out too much for now.

346
00:23:15,630 --> 00:23:16,670
Just rest up and take care of yourself.

347
00:23:40,336 --> 00:23:42,592
(Mo Residence)

348
00:23:54,589 --> 00:23:55,349
Madam.

349
00:24:04,349 --> 00:24:05,710
When did this happen?

350
00:24:06,029 --> 00:24:07,670
The authorities informed
us this morning.

351
00:24:07,670 --> 00:24:08,710
They asked us to bring him home.

352
00:24:24,220 --> 00:24:26,220
(Coffin of My Late Husband,
General Mo Yi)

353
00:24:40,269 --> 00:24:42,109
I even knelt before you.

354
00:24:43,870 --> 00:24:45,390
I trusted you with all my heart.

355
00:24:48,349 --> 00:24:49,309
How could Zhao Ling

356
00:24:50,910 --> 00:24:53,549
do something so cruel?

357
00:24:56,309 --> 00:24:57,910
After all these years of friendship...

358
00:25:00,670 --> 00:25:02,950
How could he bear to do this?

359
00:25:06,789 --> 00:25:08,390
Why didn't you tell me?

360
00:25:11,470 --> 00:25:14,670
I thought of you as my own sister.

361
00:25:17,349 --> 00:25:17,990
Come here.

362
00:25:18,470 --> 00:25:19,230
Look!

363
00:25:19,470 --> 00:25:21,470
You're the sworn mother

364
00:25:21,950 --> 00:25:24,190
of my three children!

365
00:25:24,589 --> 00:25:26,390
Why didn't you tell me?

366
00:25:27,509 --> 00:25:31,349
Why didn't you tell me?

367
00:25:32,390 --> 00:25:34,309
These are matters

368
00:25:34,309 --> 00:25:35,470
beyond what women like us can decide.

369
00:25:35,630 --> 00:25:37,190
Why blame her for this?

370
00:25:37,269 --> 00:25:38,190
Don't blame her?

371
00:25:41,910 --> 00:25:42,829
Then who should I blame?

372
00:25:45,549 --> 00:25:47,430
You!

373
00:25:48,870 --> 00:25:50,990
Mo!

374
00:25:51,430 --> 00:25:53,069
Get up!

375
00:25:53,549 --> 00:25:55,549
You heartless man!

376
00:26:02,670 --> 00:26:04,309
Only three months after we married,

377
00:26:04,430 --> 00:26:06,870
you rode off to war to the sound
of the war horns.

378
00:26:07,670 --> 00:26:08,950
You were never home.

379
00:26:10,950 --> 00:26:12,589
When you finally returned,

380
00:26:13,789 --> 00:26:15,390
you even brought back a mistress.

381
00:26:16,430 --> 00:26:19,029
I bore you three children.

382
00:26:19,710 --> 00:26:20,910
How could you just

383
00:26:20,910 --> 00:26:22,309
leave the three of us

384
00:26:22,829 --> 00:26:24,230
behind?

385
00:26:24,230 --> 00:26:26,470
Get up!

386
00:26:30,069 --> 00:26:33,509
You get up!

387
00:26:33,509 --> 00:26:34,440
(Coffin of My Late Husband,
General Mo Yi)

388
00:26:38,829 --> 00:26:39,509
- Sister!
- Sister!

389
00:26:39,509 --> 00:26:39,990
Sister!

390
00:26:40,309 --> 00:26:40,950
Sister!

391
00:26:42,029 --> 00:26:43,470
Your health comes first.

392
00:26:45,950 --> 00:26:46,670
Sister!

393
00:26:52,910 --> 00:26:53,870
At the end of the day,

394
00:26:54,390 --> 00:26:55,109
it's my fault.

395
00:26:57,190 --> 00:26:59,349
I shouldn't have pushed him
to chase success and glory.

396
00:27:01,069 --> 00:27:02,190
It's my fault.

397
00:27:04,190 --> 00:27:05,950
I shouldn't have kept finding fault
with him.

398
00:27:07,589 --> 00:27:10,509
I shouldn't have urged him
to get involved in those donations.

399
00:27:10,589 --> 00:27:11,789
That's what led us

400
00:27:12,230 --> 00:27:15,190
to where we are today!

401
00:27:15,670 --> 00:27:17,109
It's my fault!

402
00:27:17,109 --> 00:27:18,029
Mother!

403
00:27:18,029 --> 00:27:18,710
It's all my fault!

404
00:27:18,710 --> 00:27:19,470
Sister!

405
00:27:19,470 --> 00:27:20,029
Sister!

406
00:27:20,549 --> 00:27:21,309
Sister!

407
00:27:23,109 --> 00:27:23,670
Sister!

408
00:27:23,670 --> 00:27:25,470
It's all my fault!

409
00:27:25,470 --> 00:27:27,109
Take care of yourself!

410
00:27:27,109 --> 00:27:28,589
Mother!

411
00:27:33,900 --> 00:27:36,000
(Mo Residence)

412
00:27:49,950 --> 00:27:50,950
I told you

413
00:27:51,870 --> 00:27:53,789
I had found the key piece of evidence.

414
00:27:54,109 --> 00:27:56,190
All we had to do was submit it
to Chengqian Prefecture for a retrial.

415
00:27:56,190 --> 00:27:57,990
Why couldn't you wait
even a few more days?

416
00:28:17,630 --> 00:28:19,749
Even if you obtained
the bribery records,

417
00:28:21,829 --> 00:28:22,829
what would they prove?

418
00:28:24,390 --> 00:28:25,430
This matter

419
00:28:26,710 --> 00:28:28,589
was ordered by His Majesty himself.

420
00:28:28,589 --> 00:28:30,430
He chose to sacrifice Mo Yi
to calm the Anzhou merchants.

421
00:28:31,109 --> 00:28:32,269
Whatever the truth is,

422
00:28:34,230 --> 00:28:35,430
does His Majesty even care?

423
00:28:37,309 --> 00:28:39,630
He only wants to stabilize
the situation around the salt reform

424
00:28:39,630 --> 00:28:41,109
and fill the treasury
as soon as possible.

425
00:28:45,470 --> 00:28:47,349
There's nothing we can do to save him.

426
00:28:49,710 --> 00:28:50,870
It's already decided.

427
00:28:55,470 --> 00:28:57,710
Now we must pull ourselves together

428
00:29:02,470 --> 00:29:04,190
and prepare for the next move.

429
00:29:08,509 --> 00:29:09,630
The next move?

430
00:29:11,950 --> 00:29:13,509
What could possibly come next?

431
00:29:18,749 --> 00:29:20,190
I'm afraid His Majesty

432
00:29:22,309 --> 00:29:23,990
will use this to promote me,

433
00:29:24,549 --> 00:29:25,789
and grant you an official title.

434
00:29:30,710 --> 00:29:32,309
Then we'd have to hold
a promotion banquet.

435
00:29:48,789 --> 00:29:50,910
I can play the role of Madam Zhao well.

436
00:29:52,029 --> 00:29:53,549
But I'm afraid that one day...

437
00:29:56,190 --> 00:29:57,390
while playing this role,

438
00:29:59,390 --> 00:30:00,910
I might become Madam Yu.

439
00:30:03,069 --> 00:30:04,789
And you might become Grand Secretary Yu.

440
00:30:08,430 --> 00:30:09,749
I regret it more and more...

441
00:30:11,029 --> 00:30:11,829
that back then,

442
00:30:13,950 --> 00:30:15,710
for my own selfish desires,

443
00:30:16,430 --> 00:30:17,990
I pushed you onto the path of politics.

444
00:30:39,349 --> 00:30:40,029
Former

445
00:30:40,710 --> 00:30:42,789
Northwestern Guerrilla General Mo Yi

446
00:30:44,430 --> 00:30:46,109
attempted to extort a bribe
from the merchant

447
00:30:47,029 --> 00:30:48,269
and killed her in rage when he failed.

448
00:30:49,509 --> 00:30:51,390
Having betrayed the Emperor's grace,

449
00:30:52,269 --> 00:30:53,549
he was confined
in the Imperial Prison...

450
00:31:01,470 --> 00:31:02,390
and was executed.

451
00:31:04,349 --> 00:31:05,230
Mo Yi,

452
00:31:05,829 --> 00:31:07,549
though his crimes warrant death
by a thousand cuts,

453
00:31:08,230 --> 00:31:09,549
in recognition of his past loyalty
and bravery

454
00:31:09,670 --> 00:31:11,549
and his achievements in battle,

455
00:31:11,990 --> 00:31:12,670
it is hereby ordered

456
00:31:13,029 --> 00:31:14,630
that his wife and daughters
be spared exile

457
00:31:14,870 --> 00:31:16,470
and allowed to live as commoners.

458
00:31:18,309 --> 00:31:19,549
Your Majesty is wise and just.

459
00:31:19,749 --> 00:31:21,630
This case was resolved swiftly,

460
00:31:22,230 --> 00:31:23,910
preventing unrest throughout the court
and the realm.

461
00:31:24,190 --> 00:31:25,549
I am greatly pleased.

462
00:31:25,990 --> 00:31:26,990
I hereby grant Zhao Ling

463
00:31:26,990 --> 00:31:29,309
the honorary rank
of Third-Rank General Zhaoyong

464
00:31:29,309 --> 00:31:30,309
and bestow an official decree upon him.

465
00:31:30,430 --> 00:31:32,509
His wife, Fu, has rendered
meritorious assistance.

466
00:31:32,829 --> 00:31:33,470
Therefore,

467
00:31:33,589 --> 00:31:34,630
you are hereby promoted to

468
00:31:34,630 --> 00:31:35,910
Second-Rank Lady.

469
00:31:36,190 --> 00:31:36,870
You are hereby granted:

470
00:31:36,870 --> 00:31:40,390
a gold-embroidered ceremonial cape
with cloud and peacock patterns,

471
00:31:40,390 --> 00:31:41,670
a jeweled pheasant crown,

472
00:31:41,670 --> 00:31:42,990
an annual stipend of one hundred dan,

473
00:31:43,069 --> 00:31:44,309
and permission to attend court

474
00:31:44,390 --> 00:31:45,109
on New Year's Day

475
00:31:45,109 --> 00:31:48,309
and the Winter Solstice
in official attire.

476
00:31:48,549 --> 00:31:50,190
Accept this imperial favor.

477
00:31:50,190 --> 00:31:51,670
So decreed.

478
00:31:51,990 --> 00:31:52,910
I

479
00:31:52,990 --> 00:31:54,349
thank His Majesty
for his gracious favor.

480
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:14,400
(Imperial Decree)

481
00:32:16,230 --> 00:32:16,910
I humbly thank

482
00:32:17,509 --> 00:32:18,910
Your Majesty for this gracious favor.

483
00:32:42,069 --> 00:32:43,430
He fought against Grand Secretary Yu

484
00:32:43,670 --> 00:32:44,470
and lost.

485
00:32:44,470 --> 00:32:45,670
Yet his rank was raised.

486
00:32:45,990 --> 00:32:48,509
A promotion in honorary rank
from fourth rank to senior third rank.

487
00:32:48,509 --> 00:32:49,710
And all in such a short time.

488
00:32:50,309 --> 00:32:51,470
Not to mention

489
00:32:51,470 --> 00:32:52,430
that bracelet.

490
00:32:52,589 --> 00:32:54,230
It was worn by His Majesty himself.

491
00:32:54,829 --> 00:32:56,829
He is the only one in the entire court
who possesses one.

492
00:32:56,990 --> 00:32:59,870
His third-rank wife
was elevated to the second rank.

493
00:33:01,430 --> 00:33:02,349
Such a thing

494
00:33:02,789 --> 00:33:05,990
has never happened since the founding
of the dynasty.

495
00:33:06,430 --> 00:33:07,950
His Majesty is making it clear

496
00:33:07,950 --> 00:33:09,589
to all officials in the court

497
00:33:09,589 --> 00:33:11,589
that Zhao Ling

498
00:33:11,589 --> 00:33:12,670
is his trusted aide,

499
00:33:13,509 --> 00:33:14,990
not the Northwest's man.

500
00:33:17,029 --> 00:33:19,870
Right now, you can't tell
whether he won or lost,

501
00:33:20,509 --> 00:33:21,069
because

502
00:33:21,069 --> 00:33:23,230
the decisive moment has yet to come.

503
00:33:23,749 --> 00:33:24,990
The Emperor's biggest concern

504
00:33:24,990 --> 00:33:25,910
is the imperial treasury.

505
00:33:26,069 --> 00:33:28,069
Whoever can solve this problem

506
00:33:28,309 --> 00:33:29,549
will become

507
00:33:29,549 --> 00:33:30,749
His Majesty's favorite.

508
00:33:32,549 --> 00:33:33,950
Congratulations, General Zhao.

509
00:33:35,710 --> 00:33:38,029
Does that lapis lazuli bracelet

510
00:33:39,269 --> 00:33:40,069
feel smooth

511
00:33:40,069 --> 00:33:41,190
in your hand?

512
00:33:46,630 --> 00:33:48,029
Grand Secretary Yu, you flatter me.

513
00:33:49,630 --> 00:33:51,349
I am merely blessed
by His Majesty's gracious favor.

514
00:33:55,269 --> 00:33:57,430
General Zhao, you are still so young,

515
00:33:57,430 --> 00:33:59,069
yet you already hold such great power.

516
00:34:01,349 --> 00:34:02,589
But do you know

517
00:34:03,349 --> 00:34:05,430
what power truly is?

518
00:34:06,509 --> 00:34:08,229
From now on,

519
00:34:10,029 --> 00:34:12,390
you must do the things you want to do,

520
00:34:13,310 --> 00:34:15,029
and the things you don't want to do

521
00:34:15,029 --> 00:34:16,390
you must do as well.

522
00:34:17,109 --> 00:34:19,509
Those you wish to kill, you must kill.

523
00:34:20,589 --> 00:34:23,430
Those you don't wish to kill,
you must kill too.

524
00:34:28,189 --> 00:34:30,669
Do you feel that bracelet in your hand

525
00:34:32,350 --> 00:34:33,910
growing heavier

526
00:34:34,390 --> 00:34:36,229
and harder to bear?

527
00:35:06,830 --> 00:35:08,270
You were born into the Yu family,

528
00:35:08,270 --> 00:35:09,470
raised in the Yu family,

529
00:35:09,470 --> 00:35:12,709
and witnessed its enduring prosperity.

530
00:35:13,029 --> 00:35:14,470
You have seen enough of the world.

531
00:35:15,870 --> 00:35:16,830
In your opinion,

532
00:35:17,470 --> 00:35:18,470
what kind of man

533
00:35:18,470 --> 00:35:19,830
is Zhao Ling?

534
00:35:21,029 --> 00:35:22,270
I think

535
00:35:22,950 --> 00:35:24,310
he is no different

536
00:35:24,470 --> 00:35:25,470
from Madam Wu.

537
00:35:28,830 --> 00:35:29,830
Like a blade of grass.

538
00:35:30,310 --> 00:35:31,270
Because he has no roots,

539
00:35:31,430 --> 00:35:33,310
he has to fight his way upward.

540
00:35:33,470 --> 00:35:34,629
He must also make everyone see

541
00:35:35,270 --> 00:35:36,470
that he is thriving,

542
00:35:36,470 --> 00:35:37,229
that he is a useful plant

543
00:35:37,549 --> 00:35:38,750
and will not harm the crops,

544
00:35:39,229 --> 00:35:40,589
so he will not be uprooted.

545
00:35:44,350 --> 00:35:45,950
You are right.

546
00:35:47,350 --> 00:35:50,229
The more someone rises from the bottom,

547
00:35:50,830 --> 00:35:52,669
the more they fear two things.

548
00:35:53,629 --> 00:35:55,870
First, becoming insatiably hungry
for advancement.

549
00:35:56,470 --> 00:35:57,390
Second,

550
00:35:57,509 --> 00:35:59,990
blindly proving loyalty to those
above them.

551
00:36:02,029 --> 00:36:03,629
Don't be fooled by the fact
that the Zhao family

552
00:36:03,629 --> 00:36:05,830
is currently at the height of its glory,

553
00:36:05,910 --> 00:36:07,669
enjoying unprecedented success.

554
00:36:08,470 --> 00:36:11,350
In truth, Zhao Ling is surrounded
by enemies on all sides,

555
00:36:11,709 --> 00:36:13,629
and has lost the support
of the Northwest.

556
00:36:14,189 --> 00:36:16,709
The moment the Emperor
stops protecting him,

557
00:36:17,229 --> 00:36:19,069
he will be doomed beyond redemption.

558
00:36:21,430 --> 00:36:23,189
Young men...

559
00:36:25,029 --> 00:36:27,669
never know that the higher they climb,
the harder they fall.

560
00:36:27,712 --> 00:36:28,928
(Xie Residence)

561
00:36:29,109 --> 00:36:30,709
Congratulations, General Zhao.

562
00:36:30,709 --> 00:36:31,750
Congratulations!

563
00:36:31,750 --> 00:36:32,350
Congratulations!

564
00:36:32,350 --> 00:36:32,830
When you have time,

565
00:36:32,830 --> 00:36:34,430
you must visit the Zhou Residence
sometime.

566
00:36:34,509 --> 00:36:35,350
Of course.

567
00:36:38,549 --> 00:36:39,109
Please.

568
00:36:39,589 --> 00:36:39,950
Thank you.

569
00:36:43,990 --> 00:36:45,390
Do you remember back in Ganlin,

570
00:36:45,950 --> 00:36:47,509
General Mo couldn't openly favor us,

571
00:36:48,229 --> 00:36:49,629
but whenever assignments were given,

572
00:36:50,069 --> 00:36:51,549
he would quietly arrange for us

573
00:36:51,830 --> 00:36:53,229
to work alongside Mr. Zhao.

574
00:36:54,350 --> 00:36:55,629
But today,

575
00:36:56,069 --> 00:36:56,990
he has to smile

576
00:36:57,910 --> 00:36:59,629
and make everyone see how happy he is.

577
00:37:00,350 --> 00:37:02,029
Madam Wei is tied up with family matters

578
00:37:02,430 --> 00:37:03,549
and sends her apologies
for not attending.

579
00:37:03,669 --> 00:37:04,470
She sent someone

580
00:37:04,470 --> 00:37:05,830
with a generous gift instead.

581
00:37:06,830 --> 00:37:09,470
Why don't we see the ladies
from the Northwest?

582
00:37:09,470 --> 00:37:11,109
Perhaps they were invited,

583
00:37:11,509 --> 00:37:12,709
but didn't dare show up.

584
00:37:13,029 --> 00:37:13,910
Madam Zhao,

585
00:37:14,029 --> 00:37:15,350
take my advice.

586
00:37:15,669 --> 00:37:18,069
A husband is a woman's lifelong support.

587
00:37:18,069 --> 00:37:19,549
On such a joyous occasion,

588
00:37:19,549 --> 00:37:21,310
don't let outsiders ruin your mood.

589
00:37:21,470 --> 00:37:22,430
Exactly.

590
00:37:22,669 --> 00:37:24,189
A married woman should
follow her husband.

591
00:37:24,430 --> 00:37:25,629
Now that you are the lady
of the household,

592
00:37:25,709 --> 00:37:27,270
your every word and action

593
00:37:27,270 --> 00:37:28,750
represent the Zhao family.

594
00:37:28,750 --> 00:37:30,390
As long as husband and wife
stand together,

595
00:37:30,470 --> 00:37:31,830
you can look forward to

596
00:37:31,830 --> 00:37:33,229
a life of wealth and glory.

597
00:37:33,229 --> 00:37:34,310
Exactly.

598
00:37:34,549 --> 00:37:35,029
Here.

599
00:37:35,270 --> 00:37:36,270
Madam Zhao,

600
00:37:36,470 --> 00:37:37,430
have another drink.

601
00:37:37,750 --> 00:37:38,270
Cheers.

602
00:37:38,470 --> 00:37:38,910
Cheers.

603
00:37:38,990 --> 00:37:39,750
General Zhao,

604
00:37:39,950 --> 00:37:41,870
if you ever need our help,

605
00:37:41,870 --> 00:37:42,990
just say the word.

606
00:37:45,430 --> 00:37:46,310
General Zhao,

607
00:37:46,310 --> 00:37:47,629
you are the one most favored
by His Majesty.

608
00:37:47,629 --> 00:37:48,990
But we wonder,

609
00:37:48,990 --> 00:37:51,189
what does His Majesty truly think
of the new salt reform?

610
00:37:51,350 --> 00:37:52,589
General Zhao,

611
00:37:52,589 --> 00:37:53,910
could you give us some insight?

612
00:37:54,310 --> 00:37:55,229
Yes.

613
00:37:55,229 --> 00:37:56,470
What is His Majesty's stance

614
00:37:56,470 --> 00:37:57,910
on the salt reform?

615
00:37:57,910 --> 00:37:59,669
We hope you can enlighten us,
General Zhao.

616
00:37:59,910 --> 00:38:01,270
Please enlighten us.

617
00:38:07,750 --> 00:38:08,549
General Zhao is drunk.

618
00:38:08,549 --> 00:38:09,790
Help him get some rest.

619
00:38:10,870 --> 00:38:11,229
General.

620
00:38:11,229 --> 00:38:12,069
Mr. Zhao.

621
00:38:12,189 --> 00:38:12,750
Come on. Easy.

622
00:38:13,109 --> 00:38:13,629
Careful.

623
00:38:15,870 --> 00:38:16,629
Farewell, General Zhao.

624
00:38:16,629 --> 00:38:17,790
Take care, General Zhao.

625
00:38:17,790 --> 00:38:18,549
Farewell, General Zhao.

626
00:38:24,980 --> 00:38:27,168
(Next Episode)

627
00:38:27,350 --> 00:38:28,830
I'm afraid that one day,

628
00:38:29,509 --> 00:38:31,189
I may have to abandon everyone,

629
00:38:31,430 --> 00:38:32,470
including you.

630
00:38:33,709 --> 00:38:34,669
Then perhaps

631
00:38:35,229 --> 00:38:36,509
we should end our marriage.

632
00:38:36,990 --> 00:38:39,270
I will never leave you alone
in the capital.

633
00:38:39,390 --> 00:38:40,549
You can't beat them.

634
00:38:40,870 --> 00:38:41,669
Nonsense!

635
00:38:41,990 --> 00:38:43,350
What nonsense are you talking about?

636
00:38:43,629 --> 00:38:44,990
The more chaotic this household becomes,

637
00:38:45,189 --> 00:38:46,470
the happier I am.

638
00:38:46,790 --> 00:38:49,350
I have a thousand ways to kill her.

639
00:38:49,549 --> 00:38:50,950
One used me.

640
00:38:51,470 --> 00:38:52,750
The other threatened me.

641
00:38:53,270 --> 00:38:54,470
Young Lord Yu,

642
00:38:54,910 --> 00:38:56,390
watch yourself.

643
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:14,120
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

644
00:39:17,720 --> 00:39:22,080
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

645
00:39:24,200 --> 00:39:28,840
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

646
00:39:29,080 --> 00:39:31,880
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

647
00:39:33,040 --> 00:39:37,680
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

648
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:47,720
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

649
00:39:48,600 --> 00:39:55,120
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

650
00:39:56,080 --> 00:39:59,520
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

651
00:40:00,040 --> 00:40:04,240
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

652
00:40:04,520 --> 00:40:10,200
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

653
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:26,200
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

654
00:40:30,120 --> 00:40:34,120
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

655
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:40,520
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

656
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:43,520
♪Kept close within my heart♪

657
00:40:44,600 --> 00:40:49,440
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

658
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:59,880
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

659
00:41:00,760 --> 00:41:07,240
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

660
00:41:08,120 --> 00:41:11,640
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

661
00:41:12,080 --> 00:41:16,440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

662
00:41:16,640 --> 00:41:22,360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
